    "BatchNorm: local per-rank batch statistics (no SyncBatchNorm); DDP broadcast_buffers=False, so each rank keeps its own running stats (saved in its own checkpoint); rank 0's are used for val, test and best.pt",
    "fp32 only: no AMP, TF32 disabled for matmul and cuDNN; cudnn.benchmark=on",
    "2-node loss: CE(sum over local samples) / G * world_size; DDP averages over world_size -> exact mean gradient of the global batch",
    "head=logits: logits + CrossEntropyLoss",
    "steps_rank<r>.csv: t_fwd = forward+loss, t_bwd = backward (incl. DDP all_reduce), t_opt = optimizer.step, t_step = batch gather + fwd + bwd + opt (CUDA events); loss = local mean CE; rows are written at every checkpoint and at the end of each epoch",
    "epochs_rank<r>.csv: time_s = max over ranks of the training-loop time without checkpoint saves and without downtime between a crash and --resume; ckpt_s = this rank's time spent saving mid-epoch checkpoints; val metrics come from rank 0",
    "checkpoints: every rank saves checkpoints/<run_id>/rank<r>/last.pt every 1000 steps and at the end of every epoch (tmp + fsync + rename + folder fsync; previous kept as last.pt.prev); rank 0 also keeps best.pt",
    "process group timeout 120 s: a rank that loses its peer exits",
    "--max-steps caps steps per epoch",
    "warm-up: 3 fwd/bwd + 1 eval forward on a deep copy of the model before training, with the same shapes as training (cuDNN autotune happens here, not in timed steps) (kernel init only; weights, BN stats and RNG unchanged)"
